    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d847">

                <pb facs="0914" n="794" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg794"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Russian
                        Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-08-26"><hi rendition="#italic">August 26,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 7.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: In reply to your note of the 23d
                    instant, I have the honor to say that this government has no objection to the
                    extension of the four months’ leave granted to Commander Rytchagow, of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lena</hi>, for a period sufficient to enable him to
                    recover his health completely.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. B. Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
